aliascache coop_amb_artillery3 sound/coop_amb/artillery3.wav soundparms 0.5 0.1 0.85 0.15 2000 20000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
aliascache coop_amb_artillery4 sound/coop_amb/artillery4.wav soundparms 0.5 0.1 0.85 0.15 2000 20000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"

