// HIT YELLS - the ten SHORTEST generic American damage lines, and this time it really is the ten
// shortest: every one of the 24 in that directory was measured, and dfr_damage_01m (0.263s) and
// dfr_damage_05b (0.363s) belong in the set. An earlier draft called its selection "the ten shortest"
// while omitting both. Short on purpose: this is the reflex as the first stagger lands, and his death
// cry has to be able to replace it a few tenths later. Slightly quieter and tighter than the death
// cries so the death reads as the louder event of the two.
