// THE PRE-HIT SHOUT - ranger5 seeing it coming. NINE aliases, not the seventeen coop_av_us_panic
// declares, and that is the point of redeclaring rather than reusing: ten of coop_av_us_panic's wavs
// (dfr_panic_26a_2, 27j_2, 28m_2, 28m_3, 29e_1, 29e_2, 30f_1, 31k_1, 32o_1, 34f_1) are NOT in the
// mod's own sound tree. They resolve on this machine only because they sit LOOSE in the retail
// basepath - G:\GOG\...\main\sound\dialogue\generic\a\panic\ - so they are not in the shipped pk3 and
